{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>520（我愛你）這個充滿閃光的日子，藝人唐禹哲的辣妻蘇小軒（Becky），20日無預警在社群平台上放閃兼報喜，宣布自己已經懷上第二胎。她感性寫下：</p><p>她感性寫下：</p><p>消息一出，立刻引來大批網友與演藝圈好友瘋狂刷一整排恭喜，直呼「太驚喜了！」</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250215/967444382296969216341680.jpeg/BZfMlc7Nk_1L2eR3K9rj76yIYBqcOhw_aPVHLmj1Ry4\" alt=\"唐禹哲與混血辣妻蘇小軒公佈喜訊懷二胎。（IG@xiaoxuansu）\"><figcaption>唐禹哲與混血辣妻蘇小軒公佈喜訊懷二胎。（IG@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><p>更多唐禹哲、蘇小軒照片：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805691262472192865720.jpeg/mS9LTyX4fKkUcTcDga48-jvzOmY_0A0_1DNvUNQzb1A\" alt=\"唐禹哲報喜訊，辣妻蘇小軒懷二胎，曬出超聲波照。（IG@dt_0902）\"><figcaption>唐禹哲報喜訊，辣妻蘇小軒懷二胎，曬出超聲波照。（IG@dt_0902）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805689202937856613042.jpeg/hnu1QvGpq5qQNUnFxvUP8CrSbRc9AmkeNTa7vzU2u78\" alt=\"唐禹哲和蘇小軒已有一子。（IG@dt_0902）\"><figcaption>唐禹哲和蘇小軒已有一子。（IG@dt_0902）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805687646720000359260.jpeg/jaIWdOZKzj0BmTt_wljR9OTjJo4F7oDEyPos4cj6LOE\" alt=\"唐禹哲和蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）\"><figcaption>唐禹哲和蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805694345416704598126.jpeg/o7nXwcaZan7I6AEJ_AbUaHTcO5xNpxzWM2eq5zNnquc\" alt=\"唐禹哲和蘇小軒（IG@dt_0902）\"><figcaption>唐禹哲和蘇小軒（IG@dt_0902）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805696555945984451087.jpeg/EgihfqehWJz29M2htiyD3nGvzEZUMIKdb1jhSG9Y4Ug\" alt=\"唐禹哲和蘇小軒（IG@dt_0902）\"><figcaption>唐禹哲和蘇小軒（IG@dt_0902）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805690855493632380169.jpeg/6Uchky_xxHXhOh3NlB7kKgtNR3hdGkj_l1hUJZdYVCU\" alt=\"蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）\"><figcaption>蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805686707195904978256.jpeg/Z8HaiPFU1KIwYcGhHVitG3riaMrl-NpCHhPxcx4T8XM\" alt=\"蘇小軒和兒子（IG@dt_0902）\"><figcaption>蘇小軒和兒子（IG@dt_0902）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805696329453568578624.jpeg/SHPKEwbI75jGtDYymREgBp7mMKVY5Y8jY6KlKmOipSo\" alt=\"蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）\"><figcaption>蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805694139895808926840.jpeg/guTNQqUHwwFNcXGpjZIfYfdGOAyWBeLy-bdONPm3TjQ\" alt=\"蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）\"><figcaption>蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805692898250752854392.jpeg/6T7d5pW1YRiGoXMX9v5gq-5AjUAfOacIqz79Uas-_VE\" alt=\"蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）\"><figcaption>蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805689874026496648359.jpeg/gw3HlzpxdFpWelxF5G5NVnCIPwCIXXZbfulEaX7pRGk\" alt=\"蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）\"><figcaption>蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805692113915904982164.jpeg/CAaSPVfmcINxYOywIWkuYn-3JloQZhSs_7iXPf-4lz0\" alt=\"蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）\"><figcaption>蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805688301031424723615.jpeg/LhdUCn5P2QLu3B4M1SX1OeyRHl3U5C1YlnWtTZZ1rU0\" alt=\"蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）\"><figcaption>蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805694932619264762394.jpeg/Nb53Yos9w7l64Ot2PQRJlK4mEtMwe6rRBrfKlwa3ypc\" alt=\"蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）\"><figcaption>蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805697289949184584731.jpeg/JcQQNzTDYNKT7s1Z0Dqr_0Kr5Dgn_708kmvLv5Jry78\" alt=\"蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）\"><figcaption>蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805687554445312231596.jpeg/LWZrYiGf9nUfpZUhNjRMkPWwr8RicjvjW2_x3ltv8d4\" alt=\"蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）\"><figcaption>蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805690104713216781469.jpeg/SYurKrzqnIJvEqg4mabQkUxLASStBr1OkAwLx5AMC8c\" alt=\"蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）\"><figcaption>蘇小軒（IG@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><p>蘇小軒同時也加碼分享了一段溫馨指數破表的短片。影片開頭，唐禹哲、蘇小軒與大兒子的手層層疊在一起，隨著雙手依序移開，最後揭曉了二寶清晰的超音波照片。</p><p>隨後畫面轉到全家人的甜蜜合照，大兒子開心地拿著超音波照片，唐禹哲又是對鏡頭大方比愛心、又是把兒子一把抱進懷裡，蘇小軒則在一旁對著鏡頭甜笑、眨眼，四口之家的互動畫面簡直甜到長螞蟻。</p><p>蘇小軒透露，大兒子平時就常常嚷嚷著想要一個弟弟或妹妹，沒想到這次真的願望成真，讓她忍不住打趣直呼：「可能就是被他的吸引力法則呼喚了噢！」除了分享懷孕喜悅，她更不忘大方放閃，公開感謝老公唐禹哲這段時間無微不至的照顧，天天開啟「寵妻魔人」模式，包辦每日的餵食與全身按摩，貼心舉動讓她幸福笑稱：</p><p>這顆520大閃彈瞬間震撼網路，大批粉絲紛紛湧入留言區獻上祝福：</p><p>「哇哇哇！！終於公佈了！」</p><p>「好期待小情人的可愛妹妹或弟弟。」</p><p>有趣的是，還有不少「鷹眼網友」化身柯南，留言直呼早就發現端倪：「我就知道啊啊啊啊啊啊！母親節的時候就感覺外表有變了！！！」</p><p>【延伸閱讀】朴信惠嫁崔泰俊後再傳喜訊　時隔4年懷二胎　爆預產期將停工養胎（點圖放大瀏覽▼▼▼）</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241123/936790911281532928317958.jpeg/MM0svFzQMs0WIPQBMoxMMl-lQ2VfLZGzKHZt2yh2bds\" alt=\"【延伸閱讀】朴信惠嫁崔泰俊後再傳喜訊　時隔4年懷二胎　爆預產期將停工養胎（《繼承者們》劇照）\"><figcaption>【延伸閱讀】朴信惠嫁崔泰俊後再傳喜訊　時隔4年懷二胎　爆預產期將停工養胎（《繼承者們》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240922/914496401978167296827436.jpeg/D1PrqaRKwRxWFv-jG1lYnRPXU1zeTJDc3S8ygN0vMoA\" alt=\"韓國女星朴信惠近日傳出再度懷孕的消息，有多位娛樂相關人士透露，她目前正懷著第二胎，預產期估計在今年秋天。（IG@ssinz7）\"><figcaption>韓國女星朴信惠近日傳出再度懷孕的消息，有多位娛樂相關人士透露，她目前正懷著第二胎，預產期估計在今年秋天。（IG@ssinz7）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220219/571689200148025344825346.jpeg/X6iuczq4tQClnVG3XdjCBNZOq9rqDgqhd8tVeHfLVXg\" alt=\"朴信惠和崔泰俊婚紗照。（IG@laciel.co.kr）\"><figcaption>朴信惠和崔泰俊婚紗照。（IG@laciel.co.kr）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220123/561900218417680384214538.jpeg/jA99mG2z56CSV6c5VCqqm8xVTrkQ6cInzC8Sp8wvEqc\" alt=\"朴信惠和崔泰俊婚紗照。（IG@salt_ent）\"><figcaption>朴信惠和崔泰俊婚紗照。（IG@salt_ent）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220331/586264221260451840495081.jpeg/yeR2FQDQXx6NqDC9ZlNBCWMuLFqlE4V7sxoPurMaD7o\" alt=\"朴信惠和崔泰俊婚紗照。（IG@salt_ent）\"><figcaption>朴信惠和崔泰俊婚紗照。（IG@salt_ent）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200831/377087605562544128.jpeg/x5dKaCwuLF8U1kMOIoATmxeb6z05hrVYp5RZxaeUWcU\" alt=\"朴信惠（《繼承者們》海報）\"><figcaption>朴信惠（《繼承者們》海報）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241105/930529337654906880428907.jpeg/BI_qWajJPl8WaJhch471oFIDU44LS8kYuC6Q6rgukOo\" alt=\"朴信惠（《來自地獄的法官》劇照）\"><figcaption>朴信惠（《來自地獄的法官》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240922/914496401764126720230946.jpeg/DCpWkmpn8ikakzUsKFNy7xOS-803vm24kWuwy5FrsMs\" alt=\"朴信惠（IG@ssinz7）\"><figcaption>朴信惠（IG@ssinz7）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240922/914499996072546304163894.jpeg/PzMmAhNz1Rnq8F7Uo32Mrc0aWwyS1VmQB7pItwe6SLc\" alt=\"朴信惠（IG@ssinz7）\"><figcaption>朴信惠（IG@ssinz7）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240922/914496399503265792615983.jpeg/UeJtX0yvuASsILcvTSZ9sV8r5C7JdyXrlNV1-JTVdfg\" alt=\"朴信惠（IG@ssinz7）\"><figcaption>朴信惠（IG@ssinz7）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240922/914496398857342976238645.jpeg/ojgAblkOu_f5K0RKI4LUSLcBnKbLbEqzp-Lfcafi33E\" alt=\"朴信惠（IG@ssinz7）\"><figcaption>朴信惠（IG@ssinz7）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240922/914496394776023040978165.jpeg/I9_Bf7bdTSN3AYA-y56U0gRrgWWlrGe7H1XCPh9Vwj4\" alt=\"朴信惠（IG@ssinz7）\"><figcaption>朴信惠（IG@ssinz7）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240202/829943421429878784948352.jpeg/DHQAhb9Qi_lFJSss76EUcRr6jI_k4fMZ9_a3Avf2twI\" alt=\"朴信惠（IG@ssinz7）\"><figcaption>朴信惠（IG@ssinz7）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閱讀：</p><p>唐禹哲升格豪門女婿！傳與台美混血千金蘇小軒登記結婚</p><p>唐禹哲罕曬與蘇小軒之子清晰側顏 網直呼「一模一樣」讚：帥氣滿分</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-20T09:41:45.644185+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1394,"images":31,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}